90918,"y":0.21947674413183882,"h":0.010174418567717725},{"text":"Read the text again. Choose the correct answer A-D.","h":0.011792498166912524,"y":0.22093023289917679,"x":0.032679746519001608,"w":0.41394332885742186},{"h":0.013085025831821251,"x":0.032679747238338802,"w":0.40958602905273434,"text":"1 Which of the following is true about The Shawshank","y":0.23837209330799891},{"y":0.25282783612257331,"h":0.011786188511526907,"x":0.058802910257940655,"text":"Redemption?","w":0.10025910377502442},{"y":0.26727726868043766,"w":0.21568626403808597,"h":0.013322231870805279,"text":"A It got many movie awards.","x":0.058823532432663722},{"x":0.056644882133300954,"h":0.010407993338884314,"w":0.1960784339904785,"text":"B It was based on a book.","y":0.28184845954887727},{"w":0.2047930145263672,"x":0.058823538869713941,"text":"C It was a financial success.","y":0.29641965025449046,"h":0.011719884324530305},{"h":0.01332223187080539,"text":"D It has always been popular.","w":0.22004356384277343,"y":0.31099084080531825,"x":0.0588235358346045},{"text":"2 What do we learn about the plot of the film?","y":0.32847626993727808,"w":0.35511981964111328,"h":0.011656952539550458,"x":0.032679745146763535},{"y":0.34302325617137097,"w":0.32897602081298827,"h":0.013081394961037107,"x":0.058823539511806473,"text":"A It is based on events that really happened"},{"w":0.26433025360107426,"text":"B Its hero faces capital punishment.","x":0.058492496817370884,"y":0.3532381715068923,"h":0.018907219841517997},{"h":0.013322231870805279,"w":0.24618736267089844,"text":"C It shows the cruelty of inmates.","x":0.058823531700135302,"y":0.37052456271088985},{"h":0.013322231076738467,"w":0.2483660125732422,"text":"D It is about not giving up in life.","x":0.058823533074308328,"y":0.38509575355152781},{"text":"3 Why did Tim Robbins go back to prison?","x":0.032679740470603812,"w":0.32679737091064454,"h":0.011833645918287838,"y":0.40406976779501014},{"text":"A He wanted to share his acting skills with people",